# SHA-256 of the prebuilt LLVM release archives that setup-llvm.sh may download,
# for the version pinned in .llvm-version. Format: "<sha256>  <archive-name>"
# (the layout `shasum -a 256` / `sha256sum` emit, so it stays greppable).
#
# Bump this together with .llvm-version. Regenerate the digests authoritatively
# from the GitHub release (no large download needed):
#
#   gh api repos/llvm/llvm-project/releases/tags/llvmorg-<VER> \
#     --jq '.assets[]|select(.name|endswith(".tar.xz"))|"\(.digest|ltrimstr("sha256:"))  \(.name)"'
#
# Only the binary toolchain archives setup-llvm.sh resolves are listed. There is
# no macOS-X64 build for 22.1.1 upstream, so Intel-mac without Homebrew llvm has
# no bundled path to pin (the download itself 404s first).
